# SchoolOps — Cursor Rules
# Multi-tenant School Management SaaS | Next.js 16 App Router | TypeScript

## Project Identity
- Project name: SchoolOps
- Domain: School and academy administration SaaS for Pakistani market
- Currency: PKR (Pakistani Rupee, Rs.)
- Primary users: School Owners, Admins, Teachers — non-technical staff
- SaaS layer: Developer/owner admin panel separate from tenant apps
- Language: English UI, but names/data will be Urdu/Pakistani (handle gracefully)

---

## Stack

- **Framework:** Next.js 16 (App Router only — never use Pages Router)
- **Language:** TypeScript (strict mode — no `any`, no implicit types)
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS v3 + shadcn/ui components
- **State:** Zustand for global/auth state, TanStack Query (React Query) for server state
- **Forms:** React Hook Form + Zod validation
- **Tables:** TanStack Table v8
- **Charts:** Recharts
- **HTTP Client:** Axios with typed response wrappers
- **Auth:** JWT tokens stored in httpOnly cookies (never localStorage)
- **PDF:** react-pdf or @react-pdf/renderer for receipt/report generation
- **Icons:** Lucide React only
- **Date handling:** date-fns
- **Notifications:** Sonner (toast)
- **Modals/Drawers:** shadcn/ui Dialog and Sheet

---

